{"page":138,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:82","surah":6,"ayah":82,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَلَمْ يَلْبِسُوٓا۟ إِيمَـٰنَهُم بِظُلْمٍ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ لَهُمُ ٱلْأَمْنُ وَهُم مُّهْتَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is those who have faith, and do not mix their faith with idolatry, who will be secure, and it is they who are rightly guided.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"6:82"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believed","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"6:82"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَلَمْ","en_gloss":"and (did) not","transliteration":"walam","verse_key":"6:82"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَلْبِسُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"mix","transliteration":"yalbisū","verse_key":"6:82"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِيمَـٰنَهُم","en_gloss":"their belief","transliteration":"īmānahum","verse_key":"6:82"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِظُلْمٍ","en_gloss":"with wrong","transliteration":"biẓul'min","verse_key":"6:82"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"6:82"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَهُمُ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahumu","verse_key":"6:82"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَمْنُ","en_gloss":"(is) the security","transliteration":"l-amnu","verse_key":"6:82"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَهُم","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"6:82"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مُّهْتَدُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) rightly guided","transliteration":"muh'tadūna","verse_key":"6:82"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٨٢","en_gloss":"(82)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:82"}]},{"verse_key":"6:83","surah":6,"ayah":83,"ar_uthmani":"وَتِلْكَ حُجَّتُنَآ ءَاتَيْنَـٰهَآ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ عَلَىٰ قَوْمِهِۦ ۚ نَرْفَعُ دَرَجَـٰتٍ مَّن نَّشَآءُ ۗ إِنَّ رَبَّكَ حَكِيمٌ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Such was the argument We gave to Abraham against his people- We raise in rank whoever We will- your Lord is all wise, all knowing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَتِلْكَ","en_gloss":"And this","transliteration":"watil'ka","verse_key":"6:83"},{"pos":2,"ar":"حُج